      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $V,$ given by\n\n$$\nV=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the following row operations on $V?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{2} & \u2194{R}_{3} \\\\ {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1)\\cdot {R}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$"
